      "text": "11. trim() remove leading and trailing spaces and returns its copy .\n\n12. toCharArray() --> returns string as character array .\n\n13. startsWith( String s) --> accepts an string and check wheather the\ncalling object starts with that string , if yes returns true otherwise\nfalse .\n\n14. endsWith() -->accepts an string and check wheather the calling\nobject ends with that string , if yes returns true otherwise false .\n\n15. contains(String s) --> check wheather the calling string contains\nthe arg string if yes returns true otherwise flase .",
